+# Claude Code reflection
+
+Use the active project's transcript directory supplied by the runtime. Resolve
+`scripts/find-transcript.mjs` relative to this installed skill directory:
+
+```sh
+node "<skill-dir>/scripts/find-transcript.mjs" "<active-project-transcripts>" "<opening prompt fragment>"
+```
+
+This finder parses Claude Code JSONL only. If the active directory is unknown or
+the finder returns no match, prepare a digest of this conversation instead.
+Never glob across other projects.
+
+Dispatch reviewers and the synthesizer using `Agent`, `subagent_type:
+"general-purpose"`. The tooling and judgment roles default to `opus`
+unless the user supplies an override. Preserve MCP access; the prompts prohibit writes.
